@theseOn.PDF_HostAddress = http://localhost:5227

### Generate a PDF from an HTML fragment
POST {{theseOn.PDF_HostAddress}}/api/pdf
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "html": "<h1>Invoice</h1><p>Generated using the shared PDF template.</p>"
}

###
### Generate a PDF from a URL
POST {{theseOn.PDF_HostAddress}}/api/pdf
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "url": "https://example.com"
}

###
### Invalid request: exactly one source is required
POST {{theseOn.PDF_HostAddress}}/api/pdf
Content-Type: application/json

{}

###
